  "bio": "Gipsy-Tattoo, hailing from Essen, Germany, is renowned for their exceptional skill level in the 'newschool' tattoo genre. Clients are consistently impressed by the intricate detail and vibrant colors that Gipsy-Tattoo masterfully brings to life on the skin. Their talent ensures that each piece is not only unique but also a true work of art, solidifying their reputation as one of the top tattoo artists in the area.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Essen, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany\n\nApprenti Tatoueuse 🤗🍄\n~ Pour prendre rendez-vous ~\n-Décrit moi ton projets \n-Donne moi les dimensions approximatives \n-Dit moi tes disponibilité🤘",
